{
  "language": "zh",
  "duration": 245.506,
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.68,
      "text": "然后你就会感觉你的动硬"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 1.68,
      "end": 4.68,
      "text": "从未有过如此快速的在你练上消失"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 4.68,
      "end": 7.56,
      "text": "而且呢我大概一周用个三四次"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 7.56,
      "end": 9.48,
      "text": "我背后几乎就不怎么长动了"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 9.48,
      "end": 11.48,
      "text": "哈喽我是想在那一九为的"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 11.48,
      "end": 13.76,
      "text": "有动机屏价好回来了"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 13.76,
      "end": 16.32,
      "text": "这次我又进展了很多很多右偏"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 16.32,
      "end": 18.2,
      "text": "又有效的有动机神器"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 18.2,
      "end": 19.84,
      "text": "每一样都不超过一百分线"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 19.84,
      "end": 20.96,
      "text": "但是你们放心"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 20.96,
      "end": 23.64,
      "text": "我选产品的质量不会因为它屏价"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 23.64,
      "end": 24.56,
      "text": "而降低标者"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 24.56,
      "end": 26.04,
      "text": "我们想得比价好"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 26.04,
      "end": 27.96,
      "text": "我他们一个个也是非常非常好动的"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 27.96,
      "end": 29.52,
      "text": "那我们非常多说"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 29.52,
      "end": 31.2,
      "text": "可是还使它这个"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 31.2,
      "end": 33.76,
      "text": "它是一个淡化动的神器"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 33.76,
      "end": 35.8,
      "text": "这一支我买了一只要七十多块钱"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 35.8,
      "end": 38.08,
      "text": "但是它的这个淡化动的效果"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 38.08,
      "end": 40.48,
      "text": "超过了很多很多的大海伍品"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 40.48,
      "end": 42.36,
      "text": "那个它其实是一个叫高果"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 42.36,
      "end": 43.84,
      "text": "之前我给你们分享过这个"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 43.84,
      "end": 45.72,
      "text": "这个也是我韩国的比格"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 45.72,
      "end": 46.72,
      "text": "把它罢给我推荐的"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 46.72,
      "end": 48.32,
      "text": "它让我用这个买淡化动力"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 48.32,
      "end": 50.52,
      "text": "但是这一支它的这个制定性"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 50.52,
      "end": 52.76,
      "text": "我们看就是很厚实的这种制定"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 52.76,
      "end": 53.88,
      "text": "高度的不敢多用"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 53.88,
      "end": 55.56,
      "text": "我们就怕它厚厚的会无礼"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 55.56,
      "end": 56.96,
      "text": "但后来我就发现了"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 56.96,
      "end": 57.84,
      "text": "这个没办的"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 57.84,
      "end": 59.56,
      "text": "而且我买的是加小白"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 59.56,
      "end": 60.92,
      "text": "这个的制定呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 60.92,
      "end": 62.68,
      "text": "就非常非常新厂"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 62.68,
      "end": 63.36,
      "text": "是最终的"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 63.36,
      "end": 64.08,
      "text": "无诺状的"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 64.08,
      "end": 66.08,
      "text": "它就可以在我们的斗营上"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 66.08,
      "end": 66.88,
      "text": "多土一些"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 66.88,
      "end": 69.04,
      "text": "然后很饭的用力去按摩"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 69.04,
      "end": 70.68,
      "text": "加快皮膚的洗手"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 70.68,
      "end": 72.32,
      "text": "然后你就会感觉你的斗营子"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 72.32,
      "end": 74.2,
      "text": "从未有过如此快速的"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 74.2,
      "end": 75.4,
      "text": "在那边上消失"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 75.4,
      "end": 78.04,
      "text": "下一个有没有背后掌斗的宝宝"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 78.04,
      "end": 79.64,
      "text": "我的后背是掌了"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 79.64,
      "end": 80.64,
      "text": "好多年的斗斗"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 80.64,
      "end": 81.92,
      "text": "然后我用算啊"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 81.92,
      "end": 83.28,
      "text": "或者是用那种做到"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 83.28,
      "end": 84.48,
      "text": "今天都没有用"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 84.48,
      "end": 86.0,
      "text": "直到我前进去遇到了"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 86.0,
      "end": 87.4,
      "text": "这个流行草"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 87.4,
      "end": 89.08,
      "text": "我跟你们说神奇到什么地方"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 89.08,
      "end": 90.52,
      "text": "就是我后悲长斗买"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 90.52,
      "end": 92.4,
      "text": "我知道前一晚上用它现实的草"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 92.4,
      "end": 94.0,
      "text": "第2天我悲伤了那个斗斗"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 94.0,
      "end": 95.16,
      "text": "就消得起司大罢了"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 95.16,
      "end": 98.04,
      "text": "而且呢我大概一周用个三四四"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 98.04,
      "end": 99.92,
      "text": "我背后机会就不怎么掌斗了"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 99.92,
      "end": 101.72,
      "text": "那它和这个土头的流行草"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 101.72,
      "end": 103.0,
      "text": "为什么区别算就是它"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 103.0,
      "end": 104.0,
      "text": "就是它这个里面是加了"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 104.0,
      "end": 105.92,
      "text": "很多的那种宝室的成分"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 105.92,
      "end": 107.12,
      "text": "所以用它洗完装"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 107.12,
      "end": 107.72,
      "text": "能生气几分"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 107.72,
      "end": 109.12,
      "text": "也不会觉得很白安干"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 109.12,
      "end": 109.72,
      "text": "是干早"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 109.72,
      "end": 110.32,
      "text": "像那个"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 111.04,
      "end": 111.88,
      "text": "我就用不了"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 111.88,
      "end": 113.52,
      "text": "因为那个喜欢时的太干了"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 113.52,
      "end": 114.6,
      "text": "就干到我这一般时"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 114.6,
      "end": 115.64,
      "text": "整个照治一块呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": 115.64,
      "end": 117.12,
      "text": "他也是只要几块钱"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": 117.12,
      "end": 118.88,
      "text": "卖得怕还会重一个这个"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": 118.88,
      "end": 120.16,
      "text": "小子在里面洗澡的时候"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": 120.16,
      "end": 121.32,
      "text": "他一到时就想说"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": 121.32,
      "end": 123.44,
      "text": "就能打出那种很有碰的泡膜"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": 123.44,
      "end": 124.24,
      "text": "好用"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": 124.24,
      "end": 124.8,
      "text": "对这件"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": 124.8,
      "end": 127.6,
      "text": "在就是一个下火的神奇"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": 127.6,
      "end": 128.24,
      "text": "就是这个"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": 128.24,
      "end": 129.36,
      "text": "广东人都知道的"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": 129.36,
      "end": 130.28,
      "text": "搬刷两茶"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": 130.28,
      "end": 131.28,
      "text": "我是在两年前"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": 131.28,
      "end": 132.52,
      "text": "就要跟你们推荐过他"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": 132.52,
      "end": 133.52,
      "text": "我不知道你们会不会是"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": 133.52,
      "end": 135.36,
      "text": "跟我一样容易长那种小"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "start": 135.36,
      "end": 137.28,
      "text": "包破裂是长那种小"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "start": 137.28,
      "end": 138.68,
      "text": "跑然后连张玉码"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": 138.68,
      "end": 140.28,
      "text": "一堆你一起谈到里面"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": 140.28,
      "end": 140.92,
      "text": "就是水"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "start": 140.92,
      "end": 141.88,
      "text": "但是你睡一觉的话"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "start": 141.88,
      "end": 143.2,
      "text": "点上又会起很多"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "start": 143.2,
      "end": 144.12,
      "text": "我后来发现了"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "start": 144.12,
      "end": 145.48,
      "text": "就是脸上起这种小"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "start": 145.48,
      "end": 147.44,
      "text": "包它其实就是上火的"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": 147.44,
      "end": 149.32,
      "text": "这个时候你用什么呼吸"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": 149.32,
      "end": 150.2,
      "text": "它都不管用"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": 150.2,
      "end": 152.56,
      "text": "就喝这个在广东超有名超下火的"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start": 152.56,
      "end": 153.84,
      "text": "搬上两茶就可以了"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "start": 153.84,
      "end": 155.52,
      "text": "我基本上喝个"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "start": 155.52,
      "end": 156.48,
      "text": "一一两天"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "start": 156.48,
      "end": 157.48,
      "text": "我脸上就像小"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "start": 157.48,
      "end": 159.36,
      "text": "包就像是个无影无种"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "start": 159.36,
      "end": 160.68,
      "text": "地点硬子都没有"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "start": 160.68,
      "end": 162.48,
      "text": "而且它在那种熬叶上火"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "start": 162.48,
      "end": 163.8,
      "text": "你其实那种火气豆"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "start": 163.8,
      "end": 164.88,
      "text": "稍微有非常好"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "start": 164.88,
      "end": 166.16,
      "text": "你前一天喝它喝的"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "start": 166.16,
      "end": 167.88,
      "text": "一屏到第二天早上起来"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "start": 167.88,
      "end": 169.68,
      "text": "那个火气豆就会消下去很多"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "start": 169.68,
      "end": 171.72,
      "text": "下一个是一家网面说"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "start": 171.72,
      "end": 173.92,
      "text": "这一只真的是特别特别适合我们"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "start": 173.92,
      "end": 175.4,
      "text": "有动机的宝宝的用"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "start": 175.4,
      "end": 177.6,
      "text": "接着你们看一下它的这个指定"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "start": 177.6,
      "end": 180.4,
      "text": "就是这种非常非常清爽的这种"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "start": 180.4,
      "end": 182.52,
      "text": "你弄指定就像我动一样"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "start": 182.52,
      "end": 184.6,
      "text": "非常非常清暴好几乎"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "start": 184.6,
      "end": 185.8,
      "text": "一遍都不会有"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "start": 185.8,
      "end": 187.32,
      "text": "你是无影配方的"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "start": 187.32,
      "end": 188.6,
      "text": "它可以帮我控油"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "start": 188.6,
      "end": 189.64,
      "text": "无书板保持"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "start": 189.64,
      "end": 190.52,
      "text": "还是可以看一下"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "start": 190.52,
      "end": 192.32,
      "text": "而且这一只早晚都能用"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "start": 192.32,
      "end": 193.52,
      "text": "也可以跟别的什么"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "start": 193.52,
      "end": 194.76,
      "text": "虽然那一种大配"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "start": 194.76,
      "end": 195.76,
      "text": "非常的摆达"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "start": 195.76,
      "end": 197.36,
      "text": "这一只的话是75"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "start": 197.36,
      "end": 198.0,
      "text": "好深"
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "start": 198.0,
      "end": 199.92,
      "text": "然后我买来大概就70块"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "start": 199.92,
      "end": 202.4,
      "text": "我觉得它这只能是没有缺点做太好"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "start": 202.4,
      "end": 203.92,
      "text": "最后是一个心理皮膚的"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "start": 203.92,
      "end": 207.2,
      "text": "那么不要是这只你超红皮超有效"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "start": 207.2,
      "end": 210.72,
      "text": "400分之30%的火酸加52的水洋"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "start": 210.72,
      "end": 212.16,
      "text": "算一块像皮的保防"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "start": 212.16,
      "end": 213.48,
      "text": "你们一定要试试它"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "start": 213.48,
      "end": 214.72,
      "text": "值得会爱死它"
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "start": 214.72,
      "end": 217.08,
      "text": "因为它心理皮膚的效果"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "start": 217.08,
      "end": 218.0,
      "text": "非常快"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "start": 218.0,
      "end": 220.64,
      "text": "而且它出头猫猫的效果也很好"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "start": 220.64,
      "end": 222.4,
      "text": "我几年前有在时间皮膚"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "start": 222.4,
      "end": 223.44,
      "text": "特别难受"
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "start": 223.44,
      "end": 224.8,
      "text": "然后我就经常用它"
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "start": 224.8,
      "end": 226.72,
      "text": "那段时间皮膚特别好特别"
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "start": 226.8,
      "end": 227.56,
      "text": "你什么"
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "start": 227.56,
      "end": 228.8,
      "text": "利用粉丝都远利用"
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "start": 228.8,
      "end": 229.76,
      "text": "因为它更多猫猫"
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "start": 229.76,
      "end": 231.04,
      "text": "然后又这么的有效果"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "start": 231.04,
      "end": 232.8,
      "text": "我经常把它用在身体上"
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "start": 232.8,
